<title>USA: AMBAC hires Lerch for Western Region munis.</title>
<headline>AMBAC hires Lerch for Western Region munis.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said Monday it hired Jennifer Lerch as a vice president for the public finance group's Western Region team.</p>
<p>AMBAC, a unit of AMBAC Inc, said Lerch's responsibilities for the region will include underwriting, client relationships, business development and new products.</p>
<p>Lerch joins AMBAC from Capital Ideas Consulting Group, a municipal advisory firm.</p>
<p>--((Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652))</p>
